# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify header rules.
#
# The Content-Type on signal_audit.py is the important line. Served as
# anything executable-looking, some hosts treat a root-level .py as a
# serverless function rather than a static asset — the single most
# likely deploy failure for this page.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()

/signal_audit.py
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300

/*.csv
  Content-Type: text/csv; charset=utf-8

/domains/*
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
